7. The emulation function returns RAISE_EXCEPTION to the filter function if an exception has to be raised (the

exception_cause field indicates the cause). Otherwise, the emulation function returns DO_NOT_ RAISE_EX-

CEPTION. In the first case, the result is provided by the user exception handler called by the filter function. In

